text = "PLAYER 1:  A / D move,  W jump,  S crouch,  F attack,  G special

PLAYER 2:  Left / Right move,  Up jump,  Down crouch,  Period (.) attack,  Slash (/) special

Special: once per match, only while below 25% health or during a bounce back.

Bounce back: the first time your health drops below 25% you heal 30 HP and deal 1.5x damage for 8 seconds.

Esc during a fight returns to map selection."
